{"id":"batalha","lemma":"batalha","pos":"noun","rank":890,"glosses":["battle (general action, fight, or encounter; a combat)"],"ipa":"/bɐˈta.ʎɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/Pt-pt_Batalha_FF.ogg/Pt-pt_Batalha_FF.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"batalhas"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom morreu na batalha.","en":"Tom died in battle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/494874","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to die","l":"morrer"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Eles perderam a batalha.","en":"They lost the battle.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Os soldados estão prontos para a batalha.","en":"The soldiers are ready for battle.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"soldier","l":"soldado"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"ready, finished","l":"pronto"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"O navio não estava pronto para a batalha.","en":"The ship wasn't ready for battle.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"ready, finished"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Você pode vencer todas as batalhas e perder a guerra.","en":"You can win all the battles yet lose the war.","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to win"},{"g":"every","l":"todo"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to lose"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"war"}]}]}